1
00:00:00,336 --> 00:00:08,490
Welcome to PremaDesk. This walkthrough shows how hotel
managers and general managers can oversee daily operations.

2
00:00:08,996 --> 00:00:15,990
Sign in with your work email and password. If you manage
more than one hotel, select the right one from Property.

3
00:00:16,493 --> 00:00:22,788
On Overview, check today's arrivals, departures, and room
readiness so you know where the team needs help.

4
00:00:23,296 --> 00:00:29,293
Open Rooms to check which rooms are in service, their
housekeeping status, and their nightly rates.

5
00:00:29,798 --> 00:00:34,111
Select Add room to enter a room number, type, capacity, and
rate.

6
00:00:34,614 --> 00:00:39,535
Use Edit to update details or take a room out of service so
it can't be booked.

7
00:00:40,036 --> 00:00:44,068
Open Maintenance to report a problem or review open issues.

8
00:00:44,577 --> 00:00:51,262
Once the repair is complete, select Mark fixed. The issue
stays in the history with its fixed date, so you can check

9
00:00:51,262 --> 00:00:52,807
when the work was done.

10
00:00:53,317 --> 00:00:58,773
Open Reservations and search by guest name or filter by
status. Here you can create

11
00:00:58,773 --> 00:01:01,426
bookings and check guests in and
out.

12
00:01:01,932 --> 00:01:07,409
Select Folio to review the guest's charges and balance. If
the guest was overcharged,

13
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:10,464
open the original payment with
View receipt.

14
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:16,895
Before recording a refund, open your own shift in Cash desk.
Enter the cash already in the

15
00:01:16,895 --> 00:01:20,274
till as the opening float and
select Open shift.

16
00:01:20,785 --> 00:01:29,047
Return to the original receipt. Enter the cash refund amount
and reason, then select Record cash refund. The refund is

17
00:01:29,047 --> 00:01:31,858
included in your till reconciliation.

18
00:01:32,369 --> 00:01:37,961
Open Guests to find or add a guest profile. Select View
details to check stay history

19
00:01:37,961 --> 00:01:41,800
and past room numbers before
helping a returning guest.

20
00:01:42,309 --> 00:01:47,303
Use Edit to update contact details or record a preference
for their next visit.

21
00:01:47,809 --> 00:01:55,133
Open Cash desk to review cash shifts for the hotel. On a
closed shift, compare Counted with Expected. The variance

22
00:01:55,133 --> 00:01:57,987
shows whether the till was short or over.

23
00:01:58,503 --> 00:02:03,044
At the end of your shift, enter the actual cash count and
select Close shift.

24
00:02:03,550 --> 00:02:10,983
Open Staff to manage front desk and housekeeping access.
Enter the staff member's name, email, role, and initial

25
00:02:10,983 --> 00:02:13,791
password, then select Add staff member.

26
00:02:14,297 --> 00:02:18,031
Use Edit to update their role, or Suspend to pause access.

27
00:02:18,538 --> 00:02:23,955
If someone forgets their password, select Reset password and
share the single-use code

28
00:02:23,955 --> 00:02:26,883
privately. It expires after thirty
minutes.

29
00:02:27,392 --> 00:02:32,655
Open Reports to review how rooms are performing. Set the
start date and the first

30
00:02:32,655 --> 00:02:35,474
date to exclude, then select Run
report.

31
00:02:35,981 --> 00:02:43,337
Use room nights booked and occupancy to see demand. Check
room revenue, average daily rate, and revenue per available

32
00:02:43,337 --> 00:02:46,952
room to understand how bookings contribute to revenue.

33
00:02:47,458 --> 00:02:53,191
Open Change password to update your own password. Enter your
current password, then enter and

34
00:02:53,191 --> 00:02:56,370
confirm a new one of at
least twelve characters.

35
00:02:56,871 --> 00:03:02,631
Select Update password and sign in again with the new
password. When you're done, select Sign out.
